                {
                  "type": "html",
                  "html": "<p>A key mission of the C4AI is to produce advanced research in Artificial Intelligence. The center congregates about 250 researchers, including faculty, post-docs, graduate and undergraduate students. These researchers investigate a variety of issues, from Machine Learning to Knowledge Representation, from Reasoning to Planning. \n<br/>Many research activities in the C4AI are organized around selected Research Challenges that combine fundamental aspects of artificial intelligence with applications in selected fields such as agribusiness, climate, and health. The current challenges are:\n<br/>\n</p>"
